        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "0DC138C9AC11B219",
      "text": "藍莓聯盟辛苦囉。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "0DC135C9AC11AD00",
      "text": "多虧冠軍換了人當，\\n原本緊張的氣氛變輕鬆啦！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "0DC136C9AC11AEB3",
      "text": "阿若我老實說啊～\\n我也想和烏栗開心地相處……[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "0DC13BC9AC11B732",
      "text": "……但現實總是沒辦法像\\n想像中一樣順利哩～[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "AF30C322A3B69568",
      "text": "不要緊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "AF30C622A3B69A81",
      "text": "總有一天！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "0DC13CC9AC11B8E5",
      "text": "不愧是現任冠軍！\\n很會說話喔！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_06",
      "hash64": "0DC139C9AC11B3CC",
      "text": "……但事情弄得好像\\n我利用了死黨[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳一樣。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_07",
      "hash64": "0DC13AC9AC11B57F",
      "text": "我是沒有那個意思的，\\n不過當下我也變得有點太認真了。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp01_08",
      "hash64": "0DC13FC9AC11BDFE",
      "text": "關於這件事，\\n讓我重新跟[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳道歉一次吧～[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "B48C79B064C08D59",
      "text": "嘿～[VAR 0x0100(0000)]。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "B48C78B064C08BA6",
      "text": "身為我們的聯盟社社長！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳今天也在加油嗎～？[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "6F8FF36E35FFF045",
      "text": "社長！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "6F8FF06E35FFEB2C",
      "text": "什麼意思？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "B48C77B064C089F3",
      "text": "哎呀呀？我沒跟[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳說嗎？\\n聯盟社的社長，\\c\\n是由藍莓聯盟的冠軍擔任唷。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_select_03",
      "hash64": "6F8FF16E35FFECDF",
      "text": "我現在才知道！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_select_04",
      "hash64": "6F8FEE6E35FFE7C6",
      "text": "我沒聽說過",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "B48C76B064C08840",
      "text": "那真是失禮了！\\n總之就是這麼一回事！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "B48C7DB064C09425",
      "text": "別擔心，別擔心！\\n大家都會幫[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "B48C7CB064C09272",
      "text": "在我是全校最強的時候，\\n我也故意不要冠軍的稱號。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_06",
      "hash64": "B48C7BB064C090BF",
      "text": "那時是四天王的大家\\n輪流負責當社長的喔！\\r\\n……因為太麻煩了嘛。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp02_07",
      "hash64": "B48C7AB064C08F0C",
      "text": "要是有什麼事的話，我會幫[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳扛的。\\n社長[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳就大搖大～擺地當社長吧～！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "E24683B6C79C3788",
      "text": "嘿～死黨。\\n上次我跟[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳說的當社長的那件事……[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "E24684B6C79C393B",
      "text": "「把事情通通丟給[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n 我覺得那是不好的！」[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "E24685B6C79C3AEE",
      "text": "……我被紫竽那傢伙\\n這樣狠狠地訓了一頓。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "E24686B6C79C3CA1",
      "text": "連以前偷懶的份也被拿出來算帳，\\n結果變成我要當社長了……[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "5A53EBD7A9F6DDC2",
      "text": "加油！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "5A53EAD7A9F6DC0F",
      "text": "恭喜！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "E24687B6C79C3E54",
      "text": "恕我直言，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]呀！\\n阿若我老實說啊～是根本不想加油！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_04b",
      "hash64": "1A16D1952E7DB5C2",
      "text": "哦哦！？死黨，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳意外地很敢說嘛。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_dragon_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "E24688B6C79C4007",
      "text": "啊～好麻煩啊～\\n超麻煩的啊～[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
